{"3355010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Squared Notebook Fight", "steam_appid": 3355010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squared Notebook Fight</strong> is a hand-drawn, fast-paced top-down bullet hell shooter where chaos erupts right on the pages of a school notebook. You control a doodled character, fending off waves of enemies and flying ink bullets through short but intense runs. Collect coins and exchange them for shields, health, or new weapons. Upgrade your hero to boost their combat abilities in the next round. Victory goes to those who aren’t afraid of the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm. Shoot. Loot. Die. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355010/extras/87fb68b85510e61966819a3a59418a80.poster.avif?t=1754601081\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355010/extras/87fb68b85510e61966819a3a59418a80.webm?t=1754601081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355010/extras/87fb68b85510e61966819a3a59418a80.mp4?t=1754601081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique visual style</strong> – Everything looks like it’s drawn in a squared notebook, filled with lively hand-drawn doodles and scribbles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom characters</strong> – Draw your very own playable character directly in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense gameplay</strong> – Fast bullet hell experience with enemy waves, projectiles flying from all directions, and zero downtime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-progression</str